Z||000007||lowCG||10-09-2001||09:45 PM||||Whatever you wind up getting,just be sure and test it out plenty on other stuff before doing the final/body panels.<BR>I've found that the reliability as well as the quality of atomization make a good paint gun.||||reg||1
